=== CAP RECOMMENDATION & JUSTIFICATION ===
RECOMMENDED_CAP: 0.05
  Analysis of candidate cap options:
  - Cap 0.03: Too conservative; max delta of +/-0.03 provides insufficient differentiation
    for triage queues when high-confidence EXIF or cross-incident reuse is proven.
  - Cap 0.10: Too aggressive; causes excessive threshold crossings (up to multiple reports
    crossing the 0.45 priority threshold solely based on forgeable or stripped image metadata,
    violating Product Rule P2 that image signals must remain weak secondary indicators).
  - Cap 0.05 (Recommended): Balances signal utility (+/-0.05 max delta) with safety,
    preventing image metadata from unilaterally dictating incident verification priority.
